    "rawContent": "---\nname: pptx-deck-designer\ndescription: Official Anthropic skill for architecting executive-ready PowerPoint presentation decks with clean visual hierarchy.\nmetadata:\n  author: Anthropic\n  version: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# PowerPoint Presentation Design System\n\n1. Layout & Proportions:\n   - Default strictly to 16:9 widescreen format (13.333\" x 7.5\" or 1280x720 pt).\n   - Maintain minimum 0.8\" safe margin on all edges.\n   - Maximum 1 primary headline, 1 subhead, and 3-4 content containers per slide.\n\n2. Typography Scale:\n   - Title: 32-40pt bold, sentence case.\n   - Section headers: 18-22pt semibold.\n   - Body / Card content: 12-14pt regular, line spacing 1.25x.\n   - Captions / Source notes: 9-10pt muted gray.\n\n3. Metric Callout Cards:\n   - Position numbers in large font (36-48pt bold) with concise 2-3 word unit labels beneath.\n   - Group related metrics inside rounded visual container boxes with 1px border and light neutral fill.\n\n4. Negative Constraints:\n   - Never use wall-of-text paragraphs.\n   - Never use more than 3 distinct font colors per presentation.\n   - Avoid decorative clipart; use clean geometric SVG shapes and standard icons.",
