    "rawContent": "---\nname: xlsx-financial-modeler\ndescription: Official Anthropic skill for generating institutional-grade Excel spreadsheets and dynamic financial models.\nmetadata:\n  author: Anthropic\n  version: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# Excel & Financial Modeling Standards\n\n1. Financial Modeling Color Convention:\n   - Hardcoded Input Values: Blue font (`#0000FF`).\n   - Calculated Formulas: Black font (`#000000`).\n   - Cross-Sheet References: Green font (`#008000`).\n   - Warning / Audit Flags: Dark Red font with light red fill.\n\n2. Modern Dynamic Formulas:\n   - Use `XLOOKUP` instead of legacy `VLOOKUP` or `INDEX/MATCH`.\n   - Utilize `FILTER` and `UNIQUE` for dynamic aggregation tables.\n   - Always wrap division formulas in `IFERROR(..., 0)` to prevent `#DIV/0!` errors.\n\n3. Structure & Sheet Navigation:\n   - Separate tabs into: Cover / Table of Contents, Assumptions, Engine / Calculations, and Summary Dashboard.\n   - Ensure all sheets have gridlines enabled and row 1-2 frozen (`FreezePanes`).\n   - Format currency values explicitly with `$#,##0` (or `$#,##0.00`) and negative values in parentheses `($#,##0)`.",
