    "rawContent": "---\nname: supabase-studio-ui\ndescription: Official Supabase guidelines for building accessible, high-performance UI components in Studio.\nmetadata:\n  author: Supabase\n  version: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# Supabase Studio Component Engineering\n\n1. Radix UI Headless Foundation:\n   - Always build overlays, dialogs, dropdowns, and tooltips using `@radix-ui/react-*` primitives.\n   - Ensure automatic focus management, Esc-key dismiss, and ARIA roles are intact.\n\n2. Styling Guidelines:\n   - Use `clsx` and `tailwind-merge` via `cn()` utility for conditional class merging.\n   - Restrict colors to semantic tokens (e.g. `bg-surface-100`, `border-overlay`, `text-foreground-light`).\n   - Never hardcode arbitrary hex values for theme elements.\n\n3. Performance & Layout:\n   - Prevent layout shifts by providing fixed dimensions or aspect ratios on image and chart containers.\n   - Use `Skeleton` loaders matching the exact structural layout of incoming data.",
