    "rawContent": "---\nname: stripe-cli-automation\ndescription: Official Stripe CLI guidelines for automated testing, webhook forwarding, and subscription simulation.\nmetadata:\n  author: Stripe\n  version: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# Stripe CLI Automation & Test Clock Protocol\n\n1. Webhook Tunneling:\n   - Start local webhook forwarding:\n     ```bash\n     stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/webhooks --events payment_intent.succeeded,customer.subscription.created\n     ```\n   - Capture the ephemeral signing secret from the output (`whsec_...`) and load into your local `.env.local`.\n\n2. Subscription Lifecycle Simulation:\n   - Create a test clock: `stripe test_clocks create --name=\"Trial Simulation\" --frozen-time=$(date +%s)`\n   - Attach customers to the test clock at creation.\n   - Advance test clock time to verify billing transitions and past-due invoice dunning.",
