    "targetFormats": ["copilot_instructions", "cursor_mdc"],
    "rawContent": "# GitHub Copilot Repository Architecture Instructions\n\n## Monorepo Code Organization\n- **Apps (`apps/*`)**: Consume packages, implement routing, and deliver user-facing layouts. Apps must never export shared utilities.\n- **Packages (`packages/*`)**: Reusable UI components, database schemas, and shared utilities. Packages must never import from `apps/*`.\n\n## Coding Standards\n- Strict TypeScript mode enabled across all packages. Avoid `any` types; prefer discriminated unions.\n- All async API functions must handle error rejection with clear domain-specific typed errors.\n- Write unit tests using Vitest adjacent to source files (`*.test.ts`).\n\n## Pull Request & Git Commit Discipline\n- Use Conventional Commits (`feat(auth):`, `fix(ui):`, `perf(db):`).\n- Every PR must include: Summary of changes, architectural rationale, and verification steps.",
    "auditScore": 98,
