    "rawContent": "---\ndescription: Production FastAPI and Pydantic v2 async rules\nglobs: **/*.py\nalwaysApply: false\n---\n# FastAPI Production Standards\n\n1. Async Route Discipline:\n   - Use `async def` for all I/O-bound endpoints.\n   - Never run blocking synchronous calls (`requests.get`, `time.sleep`) inside event loops; use `httpx.AsyncClient` or `asyncio.to_thread`.\n\n2. Pydantic v2 Schema Design:\n   - Use `from pydantic import BaseModel, ConfigDict, Field`.\n   - Use `model_config = ConfigDict(from_attributes=True, populate_by_name=True)`.\n   - Prefer `Annotated[T, Field(...)]` for request parameters.\n\n3. Dependency Injection:\n   - Enforce database sessions via `db: AsyncSession = Depends(get_db)` context generators.",
