    "rawContent": "---\ndescription: React 19 Actions and state primitives\nglobs: **/*.tsx\nalwaysApply: false\n---\n# React 19 Engineering Conventions\n\n1. Form Actions:\n   - Replace manual `onSubmit={async (e) => { e.preventDefault(); ... }}` with `<form action={formAction}>`.\n   - Use `const [state, formAction, isPending] = useActionState(serverAction, initialState)`.\n\n2. Optimistic Feedback:\n   - Always wrap mutations in `useOptimistic` to eliminate UI latency before server confirmations.\n\n3. Resource Fetching with `use()`:\n   - Use `use(Promise)` inside components wrapped in `<Suspense>` instead of manual `useEffect` fetching.",
