    "rawContent": "---\ndescription: Prisma ORM and PostgreSQL safety rules\nglobs: prisma/**, lib/db/**\nalwaysApply: false\n---\n# Prisma Production Standards\n\n1. Query Projection:\n   - Never query entire objects with `findMany()` on large tables; always pass `select: { id: true, name: true }`.\n\n2. Atomic Transactions:\n   - Wrap dependent writes inside `await prisma.$transaction(async (tx) => { ... })`.\n\n3. Serverless Singleton:\n   - Cache the PrismaClient instance on `globalThis` in development to prevent connection exhaustion.",
