    "rawContent": "---\ndescription: Multi-stage Dockerfile best practices\nglobs: **/Dockerfile, **/docker-compose*.yml\nalwaysApply: false\n---\n# Production Dockerfile Guidelines\n\n1. Multi-Stage Builds:\n   - Stage 1: `base` (core runtime)\n   - Stage 2: `deps` (package installations with layer cache)\n   - Stage 3: `builder` (compilation & asset bundling)\n   - Stage 4: `runner` (minimal standalone artifacts)\n\n2. Security:\n   - Never run as `root`. Create a dedicated user group and execute `USER node`.\n   - Drop unnecessary capabilities: `apk add --no-cache` and avoid build tools in the final runner image.",
