    "rawContent": "---\ndescription: Vitest testing rules\nglobs: **/*.test.{ts,tsx}, **/*.spec.{ts,tsx}\nalwaysApply: false\n---\n# Vitest Production Standards\n\n1. AAA Architecture:\n   - Every test case must distinctly separate Arrange (setup), Act (execution), and Assert (expectations).\n\n2. Mock Hygiene:\n   - Configure `restoreMocks: true` and `clearMocks: true` in `vitest.config.ts`.\n   - Never share mutable mock instances across parallel test suites.\n\n3. Resilient Assertions:\n   - Assert observable behavior and returned payloads rather than private internal implementation details.",
